  "name": "theme-noir",
  "title": "Noir Theme",
  "description": "Terminal noir: near-black canvas, one lime accent, hairline 1px edges and square corners. Same token contract as the duck theme with the sticker vocabulary dialled to zero — iridescence flattened to lime, glow narrowed, radius collapsed. Proof that a duck/ui install can carry a completely different identity without touching component markup.",
